-- 006: Per-category distinct placeholders + variant-aware media (Supabase free cache-safe)
-- Replaces 005's reused t-shirt images with per-category SVG data:URIs (0 storage, 0 egress, no consent vendor)
-- Hue per category + product id ensures visual distinctness across categories; variant swatch → media.color mapping preserved
-- Idempotent: deletes placeholder media for 20-60 then reinserts
